WEBVTT

01:03:58.413 --> 01:04:02.663
and something pops inside their
mind as a patterning of

01:04:02.663 --> 01:04:07.413
the neurons in their brain that is
effectively them saying, aha,

01:04:07.663 --> 01:04:10.954
I can see a way where the future
could be better and

01:04:10.954 --> 01:04:12.538
and they can actually picture it.

01:04:12.538 --> 01:04:15.246
And then they wake up and then they talk
to other people and they persuade them

01:04:15.246 --> 01:04:17.246
and they persuade investors and so forth.

01:04:17.246 --> 01:04:20.413
And the fact that this this
system can happen

01:04:20.413 --> 01:04:25.829
and that they can then actually change
the history changes in some sense.

01:04:25.954 --> 01:04:31.496
It is mind boggling that that happens that
way and it happens again and again.